Licences of the SRFI implementations under stdlib/srfi/
=======================================================

Each stdlib/srfi/<N>.scm names where its code came from in its header. Code
written for Turmeric is under Turmeric's own licence. Code taken from
elsewhere keeps its copyright notice there and its licence here
(docs/upcoming/r7rs-srfi-plan.md, D6).

File       From                                      Licence
---------  ----------------------------------------  -----------------------
2.scm      chibi-scheme lib/srfi/2.sld               BSD-3 (chibi, below)
8.scm      SRFI 8's reference implementation         MIT (SRFI, below)
           Copyright (C) John David Stone (1999)
26.scm     SRFI 26's reference implementation,       public domain
           cut.scm (Al Petrofsky, adapted by
           Sebastian Egner)
31.scm     SRFI 31's implementation                  MIT (SRFI, below)
           Copyright (C) Dr. Mirko Luedde (2002)

The files not listed (6, 9, 11, 16, 23, 30, 34, 38, 39, 45, 87, 98) are
export lists and adaptors written for Turmeric.


